// Copy to Config.local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. Config.xcconfig
// includes it last, so values here override the empty defaults there.
//
// The iOS Google client id, reversed - Google's SDK needs it as a URL scheme.
// Take the id you put in local.properties (google.iosClientId) and move the
// domain to the front:
//
//   123-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com
//   -> com.googleusercontent.apps.123-abc
//
// Leave empty until Google sign-in is configured; the launcher checks for the
// scheme and refuses politely rather than letting the SDK crash the app.
GOOGLE_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID=
